/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 42 0 R
/E (The workshop was led by U. Abhishek, who brought valuable insights into the world of design. The session primarily focused on the fundamentals of graphic design and poster creation, covering essential principles and techniques that form the foundation of visual communication. From color theory and layout design to typography and tool usage, participants were introduced to a wide range of design elements crucial for creating impactful visuals. As laptops were made mandatory, the workshop offered a highly practical, hands-on experience, enabling students to follow along and experiment in real-time.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [10]
