/E (The session was led by Charan Yelimela, who served as both the speaker and mentor. He introduced attendees to the evolving world of website development using advanced AI tools such as Cursor, Claude, and others. His demonstrations focused on building fully functional websites without writing traditional code, showcasing how artificial intelligence is revolutionizing the way web applications are created. To maximize the learning experience, participants were required to bring their laptops for hands-on practice.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
