/E (The event centered around imparting fundamental legal awareness, empowering students with crucial knowledge of their rights, duties, and frequently encountered laws in daily life. By weaving in practical examples and relatable scenarios, the speakers ensured that students could connect theoretical legal concepts to real-world contexts. This not only enhanced their understanding of the legal system but also bolstered their confidence in navigating legal situations. One of the highlights of the session was the open forum, where students actively posed questions and received clarifications on various legal doubts.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (The overwhelming positive feedback from attendees underscored the success and impact of the event. Students expressed deep appreciation for the practical relevance and clarity the session offered, and many voiced a desire for more such informative initiatives. Inspired by this success, The Compendium aims to continue its journey of creating awareness and fostering informed, capable individuals.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
