/T (On the 19th of July, 2025, the Compendium introduced its members to one of its biggest developments yet- The Compendium Official Website! The AV Centre of IARE was brimming with excitement among all the members present there about the wide scope of potential that this website would bring to the future of the Club!)
/E (On the 19th of July, 2025, the Compendium introduced its members to one of its biggest developments yet- The Compendium Official Website! The AV Centre of IARE was brimming with excitement among all the members present there about the wide scope of potential that this website would bring to the future of the Club!)
