/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (A single forum for every news article, social media post, newspaper publication, and magazine edition- this website is a guarantee for enabling The Compendium to make sure that every student of IARE has a place to be updated on the major happenings both within IARE and across the globe. This website also provides a platform for students to express their opinion, have their voice heard and be able to join a community of peers within an ecosystem that supports and encourages their passions and interests. Spearheaded by Mr. K. Yagnesh Reddy \(President of Compendium\) and Mr. Mule Bharath \(Creative Director of Compendium\), this launch set forward a new chapter of The Compendium- a chapter of stepping forward and fully embracing the world of Technology and integrating it with the media work that defines The Compendium. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (This session also covered some other essential bits about the future of the club- the hierarchy and functioning of the club, an orientation for the new members of the club and the domain heads, as well as the plans, roles and opportunities that are there in store for the future! To close out this session, some interactive activities were held for team-bonding and there was an open forum for idea-sharing, feedback, and insightful discussions among the members of the club. Overall, this session served as a bridge into the future of The Compendium IARE- a future which holds fun, enlightenment, community, and most importantly, outreach!)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
