/Title (The session offered a lively and enriching experience that challenged their awareness, reasoning abilities, and quick thinking. Participants tackled a variety of thought-provoking rounds featuring topics from current events, general awareness, and academic subjects. The fast-paced and engaging structure sparked enthusiasm and lively participation, making the afternoon both entertaining and informative. Those who excelled were acknowledged for their sharp thinking and strong performance, reinforcing the value of staying informed and intellectually active. The program not only helped sharpen mental agility and broaden perspectives but also built confidence and encouraged active involvement among students.)
